1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,155
O‘yin kuni!

2
00:00:01,175 --> 00:00:02,826
Zamin FK — Star Boys.

3
00:00:02,846 --> 00:00:06,088
Yangi stadionimizda birinchi katta sinov!

4
00:00:06,108 --> 00:00:07,918
O‘n sakkizinchi daqiqa…

5
00:00:07,938 --> 00:00:08,973
qarshi hujum!

6
00:00:15,223 --> 00:00:15,695
Gol!

7
00:00:15,715 --> 00:00:16,557
Mahmud!

8
00:00:16,577 --> 00:00:17,809
Nol — bir.

9
00:00:18,223 --> 00:00:19,979
Rustam aka jahlda…

10
00:00:19,999 --> 00:00:22,663
Ammo Zamin FK javob beradi!

11
00:00:27,863 --> 00:00:28,750
Gooool!

12
00:00:28,770 --> 00:00:29,787
Jovohir!

13
00:00:29,807 --> 00:00:31,103
Bir — bir!

14
00:00:31,663 --> 00:00:32,349
Tanaffus.

15
00:00:32,369 --> 00:00:33,211
Hisob teng.

16
00:00:33,231 --> 00:00:34,700
Echki esa xotirjam.

17
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:38,090
Ikkinchi bo‘lim — oltmish yettinchi daqiqa…

18
00:00:42,990 --> 00:00:43,835
Bekzod…

19
00:00:43,855 --> 00:00:44,824
uzoqdan!

20
00:00:44,844 --> 00:00:45,319
Gol.

21
00:00:45,339 --> 00:00:46,699
Bir — ikki.

22
00:00:46,790 --> 00:00:47,807
Yana ortdamiz.

23
00:00:47,827 --> 00:00:50,177
Lekin Zamin FK taslim bo‘lmaydi!

24
00:00:50,197 --> 00:00:52,197
Sakson to‘qqizinchi daqiqa…

25
00:00:56,517 --> 00:00:57,604
Abdullayev!

26
00:00:57,624 --> 00:00:58,711
Bosh bilan!

27
00:00:58,731 --> 00:00:59,416
Gooool!

28
00:00:59,436 --> 00:01:00,644
Ikki — ikki!

29
00:01:02,097 --> 00:01:04,425
Yakuniy hisob: ikki — ikki.

30
00:01:04,445 --> 00:01:05,555
Xarakter bor!

31
00:01:05,575 --> 00:01:08,706
Ammo klub egasi katta qarorga keldi…

32
00:01:09,506 --> 00:01:11,761
Zamin FK’ga yangi menejer kerak!

33
00:01:11,781 --> 00:01:13,893
Jamoani siz boshqara olasizmi?

34
00:01:13,913 --> 00:01:16,808
Izohlarda yozing: «Men menejer bo‘laman!»

35
00:01:16,828 --> 00:01:19,458
Balki keyingi menejer — aynan sizsiz!

